Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:56:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent slash dispatch so backend commands
 stay ordered

Slash-prefixed chat sent to a selected agent runs through the backend command path instead of normal prompt send. The controller marks that session busy while command output is pending and queues follow-up prompts so transcript order matches the completed backend turn.
